  Between those sits storage being unavailable — Safari private mode, disabled site data, a locked-down [38;5;153mfile://[39m context.
  Merely touching [38;5;153mglobalThis.localStorage[39m can throw a [38;5;153mSecurityError[39m, so [38;5;153mcreatePrefs[39m probes it in a [38;5;153mtry[39m at construction
